      "position": [1320, 640],
      "notes": "Centralized alert seam (ADR-025). Fed by the error outputs of every external call (exchange, user, vault, credential->rollback, insert). CRITICAL because a failed onboarding leaves a user un-scoped.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
